    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to present this substantial four-bedroom, two-storey mid-terrace property on Main Street, Ardagh. A versatile additional ground-floor room offers excellent potential as a fifth bedroom, home office, sitting room or multi-use space. Having stood vacant for a number of years, the property has undergone enormous investment, extensive refurbishment and reconstruction together with the addition of a renovated two-storey extension to the rear, all completed to a very high standard.\n\nThe property is being offered for sale in its current condition. Floor finishes remain outstanding throughout, including tiling and laminate flooring where appropriate. The supply and installation of these finishes will be the sole responsibility and at the cost of the purchaser. Internal joinery is fitted and finished, including doors, architraves and skirting boards, while the walls are fully plastered and finished with a clean white base coat.\n\nThe centrepiece of the ground floor is the generous open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This bright dual-aspect space includes recessed lighting, a comprehensive electrical specification and sliding patio doors opening directly onto an enclosed paved sun terrace. A door from the kitchen area leads to the hallway, staircase, shower room/WC and the flexible rear room overlooking the back garden.\n\nEnergy efficiency is a defining feature. The specification includes an A-rated energy design, air-to-water central heating and triple-glazed windows finished in an attractive sage green. A new timber door completes the smart Main Street elevation.\n\nSpecification Notes\n•Property is being sold as is, no additional finishes are included\n•Doors, architraves and skirting boards are installed\n•Walls are fully plastered and finished with a white base coat.\n•The open-plan area includes multiple double sockets, appliance isolator switches, cooker connections and plumbing.\n\nThe property occupies a prominent and convenient position on Main Street in the village of Ardagh, County Limerick. The village setting places day-to-day amenities within easy reach while retaining ready access to Newcastle West and the wider West Limerick road network. Its combination of a traditional village-street frontage and extensively reconstructed rear accommodation creates an appealing balance of established character, modern space and energy-efficient specification.\n\nCompletion Status\nThe property is being offered for sale in its current condition. All outstanding completion items, including floor finishes, certification and any work required before occupation, will be the sole responsibility and at the cost of the purchaser. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves regarding the property`s condition, specification and outstanding requirements before purchasing.\n\nViewing is strictly by prior appointment with GVM Auctioneers.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch - 1.43m (4'8\") x 1.77m (5'10\")\nNew timber entrance door.\n\nOpen plan kitchen / Dining / Living room - 8.19m (26'10\") x 4.55m (14'11\")\nDual aspect; sliding patio doors to terrace; recessed lighting; extensive electrical and appliance connections\n\nHallway - 4.43m (14'6\") x 1.28m (4'2\")\nAccess to staircase, shower room/WC and rear multi-use room.\n\nShower room / WC - 2.39m (7'10\") x 2.42m (7'11\")\nGround-floor shower room and toilet\n\nMulti-use room\nOverlooks the back garden; suitable as a fifth bedroom, office, sitting room or other flexible use.\n\nLanding / Hallway - 9.2m (30'2\") x 1.38m (4'6\")\nLarge first-floor circulation area serving the bedrooms and bathroom.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.27m (14'0\") x 3.36m (11'0\")\nRear bedroom overlooking the garden.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m (11'0\") x 4.34m (14'3\")\nFront bedroom overlooking Main Street.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.66m (12'0\") x 2.46m (8'1\")\nFirst-floor bedroom.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.73m (12'3\") x 1.64m (5'5\")\nFirst-floor bedroom.\n\nBathroom / Shower room - 2.31m (7'7\") x 2.43m (8'0\")\nFirst-floor bathroom / shower room.\n\nRear Terrace\nEnclosed paved terrace accessed from the main living area and rear hallway.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
